sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant B as Browser
    participant W as docqa-dev-web (Function URL → Lambda Web Adapter → FastAPI)
    participant C as Cognito hosted login
    participant K as Cognito JWKS (public keys)

    B->>W: GET /
    W-->>B: 303 → /login (no session cookie)
    B->>W: GET /login
    W->>W: state + PKCE verifier/challenge
    W-->>B: 303 → Cognito /oauth2/authorize (challenge, state)<br/>Set-Cookie docqa_oauth=state.verifier (HttpOnly, 10 min)
    B->>C: sign in: email + password + TOTP
    C-->>B: 302 → /callback?code&state
    B->>W: GET /callback (with docqa_oauth cookie)
    W->>W: state matches cookie?
    W->>C: POST /oauth2/token (code + PKCE verifier, no client secret)
    C-->>W: id_token (RS256 JWT)
    W->>K: fetch signing keys (cached)
    W->>W: verify signature, iss, aud, exp, token_use=id
    W-->>B: 303 → / · Set-Cookie docqa_session=id_token (HttpOnly, Secure, SameSite=Lax)
    B->>W: GET / (session cookie)
    W->>W: re-verify id_token on every request
    W-->>B: 200 page
